%% UC-02 — Onboard (self-service account creation)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Participant
    participant F as Flutter App
    participant B as Backend (Express)
    participant KC as Keycloak (Admin API)

    P->>F: Complete onboarding form
    F->>B: POST /api/v1/onboard {credentials, consent}
    B->>B: Rate limit (onboardRateLimiter), sanitize input
    B->>KC: Create user in realm hhh (role: user)
    KC-->>B: 201 userId (sub)
    B-->>F: 201 account created
    F->>KC: Standard sign-in (see UC-01)
